<title>MEXICO: Cifra Q1 net profit falls slightly.</title>
<headline>Cifra Q1 net profit falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  0.13		     0.14</p>
<p>     Net		  412.00 million	     452.98 million</p>
<p>     Revs		 5.973 bln		6.080 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     1.230 bln		1.260 bln</p>
<p>     Oper profit	283.63 million	     305.80 million</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   175.60 million	     299.17 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid    0			  0</p>
<p>	    FX gain     5.748 million	loss  1.106 million</p>
<p>	    Int earned  223.25 million	     280.22 million</p>
<p>	    Mon loss    53.41 million	gain  20.06 million</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Cifra SA.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
